      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FELIX THE SCAT (3) opened this prep with a couple of strong performances and on the back of those went around at $3.0 in a Class 3 last start over 1805m at Eagle Farm. Raced handy that day but was gone on the corner. Derby placegetter who might be worth one more chance out to this staying trip. FIRM AGREEMENT (1) travelled on the speed and battled on well to be beaten under a length by CAVALRY MAN over 2030m here a fortnight ago. Better placed out to this longer trip and should be right in the finish. FERNAO (4) appreciated the drop in grade last time out, flashing home to edge FIRM AGREEMENT out of second spot over 2030m here. Hasn't won in ages but that last effort was encouraging. CAVALRY MAN (2) defeated some key rivals here last start. This slightly longer trip is a potential stumbling block though. THE RIGHT WAY (5) has a fine record at or around 2200m. Might be the big improver with blinkers on for the first time.",
